# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/routing
# Both offers switched on: the exit node approved in the admin console, the
# network still waiting. Each says where it stands, and what it costs is
# said once under them.
wait-for Connected
expect Approve the shared network
tap Options
wait-for Offer as an exit node
expect Approved.
expect-missing Your devices can choose it
expect Waiting for approval: 192.168.1.0/24
expect Approve the shared network
expect the reader stays awake while Cobalt is open, down to 20% battery.
expect It stops carrying traffic when it sleeps or Tailscale stops.
clean
shot tailscale-routing
# The network is approved on the reader's page in the admin console, which
# the reader shows as a code for a phone, with what to tick there.
tap Approve the shared network
wait-for Scan with your phone
expect Approve the shared network
expect choose Edit route settings
expect 192.168.1.0/24
expect Or open this address on any phone or computer:
expect closes by itself
clean
shot tailscale-approve
# Back returns to the switches.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Offer as an exit node
# Switching one off is saved at once, and a switch that is off has no line
# under it.
tap-id share-network
wait-idle
expect-missing 192.168.1.0/24
